abstract: >-
  An experimental Streamlit application that classifies uploaded résumé text
  into job categories and requests matching listings from an external service.
  The bundled data, model artifacts, privacy properties, and classification
  quality are not independently validated; this software is not suitable for
  hiring or other consequential employment decisions.
